    "regime_notes": "10-day IC was 0.001103 in 2023-2025 (159 dates), 0.030751 in 2026-2030 (1157 dates), and 0.053418 in 2031-2035 (1106 dates). Interpret small-cross-section IC conservatively; breadth transition signal is likely correlated with level-conditioned reversal.",
